# mcplab CLI changes require regression tests

- Keep pure logic (parsing, env precedence, file/archive generation) in
  `internal/` packages, separate from the docker exec layer (`internal/lab`
  runner), so it is testable without docker.
- Any change to testable logic needs a unit/regression test beside it. Pin
  external output formats with verbatim fixtures (see
  `internal/mcpout/mcpout_test.go` for the `mcpjungle invoke` framing).
- Run `make test` (go vet + go test) before finishing; run `make smoke` when
  behavior touching the running stack changed.
